<!doctype html>
<!--
  The 1200x630 sharing card behind og:image — public/og-card.png.

  Same rule as the landing page: the artwork is the product. It is a real
  practice card with the real demo question, and the only amber on it is the XP
  pill, where amber still means "you earned something".

  An ERB template rather than a plain file, and rebuilt through Rails, for the
  same reason the landing page reads its numbers off constants: the card once
  said "10 минути на ден" while DailyPractice::DEFAULT_MINUTES said 15, and a
  rasterized image is the one place on the site where nobody would notice.

  Rebuild after editing:

    bin/rails og_card:build
-->
<html lang="bg"><head><meta charset="utf-8">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:wght@400;600;700;800;900&display=swap&subset=cyrillic">
<style>
  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
  body{width:1200px;height:630px;font-family:Nunito,system-ui,sans-serif;background:#fff;
       display:flex;overflow:hidden}
  .left{flex:1.08;padding:64px 40px 64px 72px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}
  .pill{display:inline-flex;align-self:flex-start;align-items:center;gap:9px;background:#f0f1ff;color:#4038ca;
        font-weight:800;font-size:20px;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:999px;margin-bottom:26px}
  .dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:999px;background:#4038ca}
  h1{font-size:62px;line-height:1.06;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-.025em;color:#312e81;margin-bottom:22px}
  p{font-size:26px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:600;color:#4b5563;max-width:26ch}
  .brand{margin-top:auto;padding-top:34px;font-size:26px;font-weight:900;color:#312e81;letter-spacing:-.01em}
  .brand span{color:#9ca3af;font-weight:700}
  .right{flex:.92;background:#f7f8ff;border-left:1px solid #e2e4ff;display:flex;align-items:center;
         justify-content:center;padding:56px 60px}
  .card{width:100%;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:22px;padding:30px 28px;
        box-shadow:0 14px 38px rgba(49,46,129,.10)}
  .meta{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:20px}
  .topic{background:#eef2ff;color:#4038ca;font-weight:800;font-size:16px;padding:6px 13px;border-radius:999px}
  .level{color:#9ca3af;font-weight:800;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.04em}
  .stem{font-size:31px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;text-align:center;margin-bottom:22px}
  .opts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:11px}
  .opt{border:2px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:14px;padding:13px 0;text-align:center;font-size:23px;
       font-weight:800;color:#374151}
  .opt.on{border-color:#16a34a;background:#f0fdf4;color:#15803d}
  .fb{margin-top:18px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;
      border-radius:15px;padding:14px 17px}
  .tick{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:999px;background:#16a34a;color:#fff;display:flex;
        align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:19px;font-weight:900}
  .fbt{font-weight:900;color:#15803d;font-size:20px}
  .xp{margin-left:auto;background:#fef3c7;color:#92400e;font-weight:900;font-size:17px;
      padding:7px 13px;border-radius:999px;white-space:nowrap}
</style></head>
<body>
  <div class="left">
    <span class="pill"><span class="dot"></span><%= I18n.t("landing.hero.badge") %></span>
    <h1>Задачи по математика с обяснение</h1>
    <p>Всяка задача е по мярка на детето. След всяка грешка — решение стъпка по стъпка.</p>
    <div class="brand">wunderkind.bg <span>· <%= DailyPractice::DEFAULT_MINUTES %> минути на ден</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="right">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="meta"><span class="topic">Дроби от число</span><span class="level">НИВО 4</span></div>
      <div class="stem">Колко е ¾ от 20?</div>
      <div class="opts">
        <div class="opt">12</div><div class="opt on">15</div>
        <div class="opt">16</div><div class="opt">18</div>
      </div>
      <div class="fb"><span class="tick">✓</span><span class="fbt">Вярно!</span><span class="xp">⭐ +24 XP</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body></html>
